Subject: [PATCH] Replay Mode 7 raster state in frame hosts

---
 docs/LLE_SCHEDULER.md             |   9 +++
 runner/src/snes/ppu.c             | 119 ++++++++++++++++++++----------
 runner/src/snes/ppu.h             |   4 +-
 runner/src/snes/snes.c            |   1 +
